                %p
                  of
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact+object+in+an+%28infinity%2C1%29-category"} compact objects
                  (i.e. every object of
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi 𝒞
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
                  is an
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-colimit"} (∞,1)-colimit
                  of the objects
