              of the values of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representable+functor"} functor co-represented
              by
              = succeed ":" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
