          #ProofFollowingLurie.proof
            %h6#proof_2 Proof
            %p
              Due to the version of the Whitehead theorem of prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#WhiteheadTheoremForCompactGenerationByCogroupObjects"}
